    "doc_id": "card-cvd-warning-signs",
    "department": "心血管内科",
    "source": "世界卫生组织｜Cardiovascular diseases (CVDs)",
    "text": "反复心悸、活动后胸部不适或耐力明显下降，建议前往心血管内科进行线下评估。",
    "source_type": "text",
    "institution": "World Health Organization",
